 =?UTF-8?q?lapse,=20favicon=20pills,=20graph=20tuning,=20live=20insights?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ActivityStrip (student): settled turns fold their reasoning+tool trail behind
  one 'Worked through N steps' row; live turns keep previews + approvals visible
- Source pills: domain favicon with letter-badge fallback (rail + inline)
- Graph: settings panel (node size / spread / repulsion sliders, auto-rotate,
  reset), applied live via d3Force + reheat, persisted to localStorage
- Recorder live insights: on-device lexicon spotting of drugs as they're spoken,
  tap-to-queue chips, post-stop 'Ask about N queued drugs' prefills the chat
- pharm-lexicon: detectPharmTerms() word-boundary scanner over the canonical list
- SOUL + evidence skills rewritten: cite inline only (no trailing Sources list —
  pills render automatically), no boilerplate disclaimers, thorough-by-default
  research-agent voice
